<title>USA: Pan Am signs lease for two Airbus A-300s.</title>
<headline>Pan Am signs lease for two Airbus A-300s.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan American World Airways Inc said on Wednesday it has signed five-year, renewable leases for two Airbus Industrie A-300s.</p>
<p>Terms of the lease with C-S Aviation Services Inc were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The additional aircraft will bring Pan Am's fleet of A-300s to five. They are scheduled for delivery by mid-November.</p>
</text>
